#. そうだ！　ボクの部屋には、
#. <CLT 3>髪の毛<CLT>が１本も落ちてなかったんだ！
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's right! There wasn't a single <CLT 3>hair<CLT> on the\n"
"floor!"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人が…証拠隠滅したって事…？
msgctxt "0002 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "So...the culprit removed some evidence?"
msgstr ""

#. でもさ、もしボクが犯人だとしたら…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yes. And if I were the culprit..."
msgstr ""

#. どうして自分の部屋の髪の毛を、
#. そこまで徹底的に掃除する必要があるの？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Why would I need to get rid of all the hair in my own\n"
"room?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、自分の部屋に自分の髪の毛が落ちてても、
#. 何もおかしくないはずだよ？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It wouldn't be unusual at all to find my hair at the\n"
"crime scene, if the crime scene is in my room."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>『舞園さんが部屋を訪れた』<CLT>という痕跡を消す為に、
#. 部屋中の髪の毛を掃除した…
msgctxt "0006 | CELES"
msgid ""
"The reason all the hair was gone...was to remove any\n"
"trace that <CLT 3>Sayaka had ever been there<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. …そうは考えられませんか？
msgctxt "0007 | CELES"
msgid "That makes sense, does it not?"
msgstr ""

#. 彼女の痕跡を消すのが目的なら、
#. 髪の毛よりも、死体そのものをなんとかするはずよ…
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"No. If that were the case, they would have had to do\n"
"something about the body itself, not just her hair."
msgstr ""

#. むむむ…一理ありますなぁ…
msgctxt "0009 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Ah-ha-ha! Yes, very true, very true!"
msgstr ""

#. だったら、どうして髪の毛が落ちてなかったんだよ…
msgctxt "0010 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Okay, then why wasn't there any hair on the ground?"
msgstr ""

#. もちろん、犯人が掃除したからよ。
#. <CLT 3>『自分がその部屋を訪れた』<CLT>という痕跡を消す為にね。
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The killer got rid of it all, of course. To remove any\n"
"trace that <CLT 3>*they* had ever been there<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. …って事は！
msgctxt "0012 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Wait, then that means...!"
msgstr ""

#. そう、犯人が部屋の持ち主だとは考えられないのよ…
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Precisely. It's simply beyond reason to believe that\n"
"the room's owner and the killer are one and the same."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…苗木君は犯人じゃない…！？
msgctxt "0014 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Then...Makoto isn't the culprit?"
msgstr ""

#. だが、そんな大事な事を
#. たかが髪の毛だけで決めていいのか！？
msgctxt "0015 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"But are you sure we can decide something so important\n"
"based solely on the absence of some hair!?"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ、苗木君が犯人じゃないって根拠は、
#. 他にもあるわよ。
msgctxt "0016 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"No. There are other reasons that prove why Makoto\n"
"couldn't have done it."
msgstr ""

#. 聞かせてもらおうか…
msgctxt "0017 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I would like to hear these reasons..."
msgstr ""

#. 現場となった<CLT 3>シャワールーム周辺の状況<CLT>を
#. よく思い出してみて…
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Do you remember anything remarkable about the\n"
"<CLT 3>bathroom<CLT> at the scene?"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さんは最初に部屋で襲われ、
#. その後、シャワールームに逃げ込んだのよね？
msgctxt "0019 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Sayaka was attacked in the main room first, then fled\n"
"into the bathroom, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人は、その後を追って、シャワールームに入った。
#. そこで、あの女を刺し殺したんだ。
msgctxt "0020 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Yeah, then they ran after her, got into the bathroom,\n"
"and stabbed her..."
msgstr ""

#. その時、犯人は、
#. すんなりとシャワールームに入れたのかしら？
msgctxt "0021 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And how did the killer get into the bathroom? Did they\n"
"have any trouble with it?"
msgstr ""

#. どういう意味ですか…？
msgctxt "0022 | CELES"
msgid "What do you mean...?"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人はシャワールームに入る際、
#. かなり手こずったんじゃないかしら…
msgctxt "0023 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's fairly certain that the killer had some trouble\n"
"getting into the bathroom..."
msgstr ""

#. その証拠だってハッキリと残っていたはずよ…
#. 苗木君、覚えているでしょう？
msgctxt "0024 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There was clear evidence left behind. Do you remember,\n"
"Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. 確かにそれは重要な事実なのかもね…
msgctxt "0025 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "There's no doubt, this fact is an important one."
msgstr ""

#. けれど、今必要なのは、
#. 現場にハッキリと残っていた証拠よ。
msgctxt "0026 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But what we need now is the evidence left behind at\n"
"the scene which proves it."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君の部屋で壊されていたモノ…
#. 覚えているでしょう？
msgctxt "0027 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You do remember what was in your room, right? What got\n"
"broken?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの部屋で壊されていたモノ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What got broken in my room...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ違うわ。
#. 落ち着いて良く考えてみて…
msgctxt "0029 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"No, you've got it all wrong. Just calm down and think\n"
"about it carefully."
msgstr ""

#. そんな見当違いの話をしたかったのか？
#. 耳を傾けた自分の愚かさを恥じる。
msgctxt "0030 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Could you possibly have been more wrong? I'm ashamed I\n"
"wasted any amount of time listening to you..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 今は発言しなければ、議論は進まないわ。
msgctxt "0032 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If you don't do something, the trial can't move\n"
"forward."
msgstr ""

#. 時間には限りがある…
#. 最悪の結果をあなたは望んでいるの？
msgctxt "0033 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We don't have all the time in the world. You're not\n"
"*trying* to lose this case, are you?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犯人はシャワールームに入る際に手こずったはず…
#. その事を示す証拠って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The killer struggled getting into the bathroom. And\n"
"the evidence that proves it is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犯人はシャワールームに入る際に手こずったはず…
#. その事を示す証拠って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The killer struggled getting into the bathroom. And\n"
"the evidence that proves it is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犯人が壊した例の物の事だよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...the object the killer broke.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人が手こずった証拠って…
#. <CLT 3>シャワールームのドアノブ<CLT>の事だよね？
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Evidence that the killer had trouble getting into the\n"
"bathroom... You're talking about the <CLT 3>doorknob<CLT>, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ドアノブが…どうしたんだべ…？
msgctxt "0039 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh? The doorknob? What doorknob?"
msgstr ""

#. 壊されてたんだよ…
#. ボクの部屋のシャワールームのドアノブがさ…
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The doorknob for my bathroom... It was completely\n"
"broken."
msgstr ""

#. ほら、上の部分のネジが外れて、
#. ドアノブが取れ掛かってるでしょ？
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"See how the top part was unscrewed, and the doorknob's\n"
"about ready to fall off?"
msgstr ""

#. ホントだぁ…
#. でも、どうしてドアノブなんかが…？
msgctxt "0042 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Oh yeah, true... But what does it mean?"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人がシャワールームの鍵を壊そうとして、
#. ドアノブごと外したのよ…
msgctxt "0043 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"In trying to bypass the lock, they ended up nearly\n"
"removing the entire doorknob."
msgstr ""

#. これが、苗木君が犯人と考えられない根拠。
#. もう１つの“部屋の持ち主ではあり得ない行動”よ…
msgctxt "0044 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"This is another most bewildering act for the room's\n"
"owner. It proves Makoto is beyond suspicion."
msgstr ""

#. 自分の部屋のドアを壊すはずねーってか？
msgctxt "0045 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"So what, you're saying he wouldn't break the door in\n"
"his own room?"
msgstr ""

#. でも、壊すしかねーんだったら壊すだろ！！
#. あり得ねーってほどじゃねーだろ！？
msgctxt "0046 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"But if the only choice you have is to break it, you\n"
"break it! There's nothing \"bewildering\" about it!"
msgstr ""

#. そう…まだわからないのね…
#. だったら…
msgctxt "0047 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You still don't see? Okay, then..."
msgstr ""

#. もう１度、事件の流れを振り返ってみましょうか。
#. そうすれば、きっとわかるはずよ…
msgctxt "0048 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Let's take another look at how the incident unfolded.\n"
"Hopefully that will help you understand..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの言う、
#. “部屋の持ち主ではあり得ない行動”の意味…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko said it was a \"bewildering act\"...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それが、事件の流れの中に隠されている…
#. そういう事なのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I almost didn't notice it at first, but...is that the\n"
"key point here?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
